From: dArkOS RG52 Mini port
Subject: oga driver turned for the RG52 Mini; /var/run/drmConn; a mode when none is preferred

Patches 0010, 0014 and 0016 of v1.22.2 for master (its libgo2 hunks gone
with libgo2): the oga video driver's turns 180 degrees round from the
OGA's, the DRM connector from /var/run/drmConn in drm_common, and the first
mode when a connector marks none preferred, in oga and in drm_go2 too.

diff --git a/gfx/common/drm_common.c b/gfx/common/drm_common.c
